.TH "PACE CONFIG" "1" "2026-05-17" "0.1.0" "pace config Manual"
.SH NAME
pace\-config \- Inspect the user configuration.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pace config
[OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect the user configuration.
.SH COMMANDS
.PP
\fBshow\fP
  Display the current effective config.
  See \fBpace config-show(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBshow\fP command.
.PP
\fBpath\fP
  Print the config file path.
  See \fBpace config-path(1)\fP for full documentation on the \fBpath\fP command.
